& [CurrentCanonicalRequirementSet: AlienHandIRCChatRefinementV2] is the authoritative requirement set after v2 hardening
  + [requirement] is raw JSONL history plus immutable payloads remain authoritative for source replay
  + [requirement] is SQLite refinement storage remains durable derived state with explicit lineage
  + [requirement] is The Lounge UI state remains accidental state unless persisted through named transforms
  + [requirement] is every durable UI surface requires data_binding, identity_binding, transform_binding, state_contract, validation_contract, provenance_contract, and accessibility_contract
  + [requirement] is Chat, Cutting, and Editing layout follows the source-to-derived transform chain
  + [requirement] is block adoption, cut insertion, chapter creation, bookmark creation, quote capture, sticky handling, edit application, TOC insertion, and source reveal are named transforms or operators
  + [requirement] is stale source, missing payload, blocked insertion, invalid anchor, and hidden-pane navigation must become visible states
  + [requirement] is future implementation must follow the ordered [ImplementationFrontier: ChatRefinementV2]

  = must: reject implementation work that hides data identity behind DOM state or component convenience
  = must: reject UI work that is not traceable to data subjects, task intent, or transform contracts

