& [Justification: AlienHandIRCChatRefinementV2] is the evidence bridge for accepting this v2 canonical record
  + [claim] is chat refinement now has strong enough rails for long-haul autonomous implementation
  + [support] is unchanged source hash, preserved source snapshot, v2 exploded specification, DataDrivenDesign quality gate, UIQualityGate, seven-fold trace, and ordered implementation frontier
  + [confidence] is high for data identity, source-of-truth boundaries, transform naming, and UI component contracts
  + [confidence] is moderate for browser visual acceptance because local browser automation remains blocked by runtime dependency and user visual review may still adjust layout
  + [counterargument] is the implementation has multiple dirty working-tree files outside this slice, so commits must remain path-scoped and avoid unrelated GodotExtension or Anne/Godot runtime work
  + [invalidation_condition] is source_change, failed_quality_gate, broken_lineage, implementation_contradiction, unreviewed_risky_design_fork, or registry_conflict

  ! [ChatRefinementV2RailsAreAccepted] is accepted
    @ [support] [SevenFoldTrace: ChatRefinementV2]
    @ [support] [DataDesignQualityGate: ChatRefinementV2]
    @ [support] [UIQualityGate: ChatRefinementV2]
    @ [support] [ImplementationFrontier: ChatRefinementV2]

& [SolutionState: AlienHandIRCChatRefinementV2] is the current solution tracking state at v2 signing
  + [implemented_evidence] is refinement SQLite storage, replay import, app-owned refinement store lifecycle, local HTTP refinement API, bookmark/quote/sticky/editorial endpoints, The Lounge workbench, live launcher, and prior runtime proofs recorded in the source and work-justification ledger
  + [v2_added] is explicit data model, transform map, operator contracts, component contracts, transition model, quality gates, fold trace, frontier order, and long-haul stop conditions
  + [not_yet_done] is runtime fetch reliability review, stale/error state hardening, insertion bridge geometry polish, source reveal edge cases, accessibility keyboard equivalents, polished quote/sticky controls, browser-click automation, production auth, and multi-client synchronization
  + [next_valid_work] is [ImplementationFrontier: ChatRefinementV2] frontier_1 through frontier_8

  = must: record future completed implementation as solution evidence with justification
  = must: keep not_yet_done visible until each item has proof or an explicit deferral

